{#- An item's image, from `imageSrc`, `imageAlt` and an optional `imageFill` crop. Assets go through picture; anything else (uploads, until spec 06) is a plain img.
    ifAsync, not if: a plain if around the async picture shortcode drops its output inside asyncEach. -#}
{%- ifAsync imageSrc -%}
{%- set asset = imageSrc | assetPath -%}
{%- ifAsync asset -%}
{% picture { src: asset, alt: imageAlt or '', sizes: '(min-width: 48rem) 48rem, 100vw', fill: imageFill } %}
{%- else -%}
<img src="{{ imageSrc }}" alt="{{ imageAlt or '' }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
